 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3848615007">February 20, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Allie is starting to come into her own as an immortal, learning more every day about her powers and how to protect herself. She is still haunted by what happened to her friend Quinn the night of the school dance. Determined to find him, Allie and her friends head into aaImmortal night club to see what they can learn, coming out with more questions then answers of what is really going on in the immortal world. <br /><br />This is such a great continuation of the previous story in the series. We see the struggles that Allie goes through because of who she is and what she is capable of. The story is so unique and I absolutely love it! I don’t read a lot of YA books, but this series has continued to draw me in and look for more. I definitely recommend this book and series.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/104549861?shelf=fated-mates" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">fated-mates</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/104549861?shelf=high-school" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">high-school</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/104549861?shelf=urban-fantasy-pnr" class="Bu